flowchart TD
    A([pytest --site --target-env --exec-profile --case-id<br/>o variables MAVI_ECOM_*]) --> B[conftest.py<br/>registra plugins de fixtures/]
    B --> C[fixtures/execution_fixtures.py<br/>pytest_configure]
    C --> D{¿Ambiente declarado en<br/>environments.yaml?}
    D -- No --> E[[UnknownEnvironmentError]]
    D -- Sí --> D2{¿Sitio existe y tiene ese<br/>ambiente en sites.yaml?}
    D2 -- No --> E2[[UnknownSiteError /<br/>UnknownEnvironmentError]]
    D2 -- Sí --> F[RunContext<br/>genera Run ID]
    F --> H[ExecutionContext.build<br/>config_loader + site_config + perfil<br/>site, env, base_url, timeouts, run_id]
    H --> I[core/logging<br/>logs con run_id/site/env/case_id]
    H --> J[fixtures/browser_fixtures.py<br/>Playwright → Browser → Context → Page<br/>timeouts + expect_timeout · cierre en PASS/FAIL]
    H --> K[fixtures/data_fixtures.py<br/>YamlDataProvider]
    K --> K2[(data/sitio/*.yaml<br/>fallback data/common)]
    J --> L[fixtures/page_fixtures.py<br/>PageFactory por sitio]
    L --> M{Tipo de prueba}
    M -- unit/architecture --> N[tests/unit · tests/architecture<br/>config, contexto, lifecycle, datasets, reglas<br/>sin navegador]
    M -- BDD --> O[test_cases/*.feature<br/>@pending] --> P[tests/bdd/steps<br/>pendiente]
    M -- smoke --> Q[tests/smoke/test_guest_checkout_ma.py]
    K2 --> R0[GuestCheckoutRequest<br/>dataset guest_checkout]
    Q --> R0
    R0 --> R[workflows/muebles_america<br/>GuestCheckoutWorkflow<br/>sin locators ni asserts]
    P -.-> R
    R --> S1[HomePage<br/>+ MegaMenu + Header]
    S1 --> S2[SearchPage]
    S2 --> S3[ProductPage<br/>+ PromotionsWindow + Notification]
    S3 --> S4[CartPage]
    S4 --> S5[CheckoutPage<br/>precio como Money]
    S1 & S3 & S5 --> T[*_locators.py<br/>solo selectores]
    S5 --> U((Sitio ecommerce<br/>MA · VIU · MAVI))
    S5 --> V[domain/money · Money]
    V --> W{Assert en el test<br/>precio mayor a cero}
    W --> X[core/evidence + repositories<br/>artifacts/runs/run_id · escritura atómica]
    X --> Y[core/reporting<br/>Allure: artifacts/allure-results]
    Y --> Z([Resultado normalizado → MAVI AI Bridge → Plane<br/>pendiente tarea posterior])
